	<meta property="og:description" content="Hare Krishna A few things have happened over the last 4 months to report. The GBC Vaisnava Calendar Committee made 3 changes to the calendar: That the observance of “Lalita Sasti” be removed from the calendar. That the observance of the “Appearance of Radhakund” be shifted to Caitra Purnima. That the observance of Bhadra Purnima ... Read more" />
